"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"97878","synopsis":"Kanon is shocked to discover that Marin, Urin, and Matsumoto have made themselves at home in her house. Marin poses as a fortuneteller to distract Suzuki from finding Kanon, who is hiding, and learns more about Kanon and her mysterious evil aura.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zPKGpDaQySFfzP9gtAXSeRqtjKj.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"97879","synopsis":"Matsumoto gives Kanon a treasure map for Kagero Island, hoping that if she finds the treasure it will improve the purity of her heart. After Kanon and Marin leave, Miyako explains to Urin of a legend about a pirate's cursed treasure within the cave.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xlFvC2d9qY7dajk599KkOQvX9Nh.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"97880","synopsis":"Amamiko Island is abuzz with activity as tourists flock to see the solar eclipse and Matsumoto fears the darkness such an event could invite. Meanwhile, the growing rift between Urin and Marin reaches a breaking point.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oKHQVOC7OZwdgWd5mYgy75HNE2.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"97881","synopsis":"The solar eclipse blankets the island in night as Marin and Kanon search for Urin. Countless mysterious butterflies and a strange woman appear from the ocean.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zhjFZLea4DZOWnuEsfyJeBtqNFZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"97883","synopsis":"In the wake of Urin's departure Matsumoto's daughter, Ichikawa, is discovered in Kanon's house. A downcast and shaken Marin decides to return to the ocean to search for her sister.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u4zeHOwSRvHYVj6EDIHy6tC2YlZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"97882","synopsis":"While heading back to the surface, Warin explains the nature Marin and Urin's relationship to Kanon. A concerned Kojima searches for Kanon, leading to a confrontation between her and Ooshima.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oarUpDd5Qllzmq5gszzvavJ0i3o.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"97885","synopsis":"Marin returns to Amamiko Island in order to regain her ability to transform. Suzuki and Kojima tell Marin about how they met Kanon, and along the way comes to understand her own feelings, as well.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zDwiSCyp5RqwognwfRZzZwjYaA4.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"22974","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102041","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"97884","synopsis":"Non abbiamo una descrizione tradotta in inglese. Aiutaci ad espandere il nostro database aggiungendone una.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eRDBsEoH1OPLTZGRbGaUn2TXE3A.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6402","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6129","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id"